IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mccpa-minor-cases`

-- Magistrates Court (Civil Proceedings) Act 2004 (WA), ss 3, 4, 6, 7, 10, 25-32, 40, 44, 45 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, the Magistrates Court (Civil Proceedings) Regulations or the Rules (not deposited).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_wa_magistrates-court-civil-proceedings-act-2004_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-chloe, event c070 (20 May 2032, Chloe 29): a new laptop
-- fails in month three and the retailer repairs it; the Act would matter "if it had not". The scenario gives no price: the
-- $2,000 claim is illustrative, and that Chloe bought the laptop for her own use is an assumption. The other fixtures are
-- hypothetical comparators.

§ `fixtures`

